msgstr "USB 또는 VIN 전원 존재"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:223
msgid "Red"
msgstr "적색"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:223
msgid "charging an attached LiPo battery"
msgstr "연결된 LiPo 배터리 충전 중"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:226
msgid ""
"In deep sleep all channels are off **except Red**, which still lights while "
"a LiPo is charging."
msgstr "딥 슬립 상태에서는 **적색을 제외한** 모든 채널이 꺼지며, 적색은 LiPo가 충전되는 동안 여전히 켜집니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:230
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "버튼"

