msgid "Bus reference"
msgstr "버스 참조"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:484
msgid "GPIO"
msgstr "GPIO"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-rt1062.rst:486
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`machine.Pin <machine.Pin>` to read or drive any of the "
"silkscreened pins. Outputs are 3.3 V CMOS and can sink/source up to 4 mA per"
